a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbf66bd653933f12\" href=\"?note=fbf66bd653933f12\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X,\\vec\\nu,\\nu\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X,\\vec\\nu,\\nu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}distribution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(E,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\sigma(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\vec\\nu\\;\\exists\\nu\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\nu,\\omega,{}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1])\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\nu(n),\\vec X(n),\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(E,\\tau,\\vec\\nu,\\nu)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}distribution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(E,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\sigma(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\vec\\nu\\;\\exists\\nu\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\nu,\\omega,{}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1])\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\nu(n),\\vec X(n),\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(E,\\tau,\\vec\\nu,\\nu)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The law sequence is a set function into the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1]\">\\({}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1]\\)</span> of candidate probability-measure graphs; the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is no longer used as a function codomain.</li>\n<li>Convergence in distribution is reduced to weak convergence of the\npushforward laws; the topology and Borel sigma algebra are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law.md","status":"resolved","id":"178443294dbca884","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob2-distribution-law.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md","status":"resolved","id":"fbf66bd653933f12","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-prob3-weak-convergence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X,\\vec\\nu,\\nu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{Polish}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}distribution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\tau,\\mathcal E,\\vec X,X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(E,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\sigma(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\n(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists\\vec\\nu\\;\\exists\\nu\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\nu,\\omega,{}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1])\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\vec\\nu(n),\\vec X(n),\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2DistributionLaw}_S\n(\\nu,X,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3WeakConvergence}_S(E,\\tau,\\vec\\nu,\\nu)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"{}^{\\mathcal E}[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2374,"backlinks":[{"id":"b01b13e1ea3167d2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProb3ConvergenceInDistribution}_S\\subseteq V^8$ 是拓扑、Borel 结构与概率空间完全显式的依分布收敛谓词（see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution.md|58-df-zfc-prob3-convergence-in-distribution]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8902399f82dbe8a2","178443294dbca884","fbf66bd653933f12","36d7463d215be751","4b3a8629f6a6f868","d4d304b0bbb11c1a"]}